# Testing

Unit/integration (Vitest)
- Run: pnpm test (TZ=UTC)
- Configs: app/vitest.config.ts, app/vitest.config.coverage.ts, app/vitest.setup.ts
- Server/API tests under app/server/api/__tests__
- Server/lib and services have colocated __tests__
- Some suites mock Prisma/Redis; DATABASE_URL dummy envs provided in CI

Forecast engine harness
- app/server/services/forecast/__tests__/test-runner.ts
- Commands:
  - pnpm test:forecast (quick)
  - pnpm test:forecast:unit / :integration / :all
  - pnpm test:forecast:performance

E2E (Playwright)
- Tests under app/tests/e2e
- Run locally: pnpm test:e2e (projects chromium-public and chromium-authed)
- Update snapshots (local): pnpm test:e2e:update-snapshots
- Update snapshots vs staging (Linux via CI): .github/workflows/e2e-update-staging-snapshots.yml

Conventions
- Use TZ=UTC in tests for deterministic dates
- Generate Prisma client before running tests that import it: pnpm --filter dineros-app exec prisma generate
- For crypto/argon2 heavy tests: pnpm test:crypto
